{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"泛等性"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"泛等性"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>在"},{"Local":{"url":"类型论","text":"类型论"}},{"Plain":"或"},{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}},{"Plain":"中, <strong>泛等性</strong> (univalence) 是两种相等之间的等价: 对于类型 $A,B$, 有\n$$\r\n(A = B) \\overset{\\simeq}{\\longrightarrow} (A\\simeq B).\r\n$$</p>\n<p>用 "},{"Local":{"url":"Segal空间","text":"Segal 生象"}},{"Plain":"表现范畴时, 泛等性体现为"},{"Local":{"url":"范畴对象","text":"完备 Segal 对象"}},{"Plain":"的完备性, 也即 “等式的生象等价于等价的生象”. (注意到等式的生象总是等价于对象的生象.)</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"UF","text":"泛等基础"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"范畴对象","text":"完备 Segal 对象"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}